tic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView/keyboardShortcut(_:modifiers:localization:)":{"title":"keyboardShortcut(_:modifiers:localization:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview\/keyboardshortcut(_:modifiers:localization:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView\/keyboardShortcut(_:modifiers:localization:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"keyboardShortcut"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI13KeyEquivalentV","text":"KeyEquivalent"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"modifiers"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI14EventModifiersV","text":"EventModifiers"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"localization"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI16KeyboardShortcutV","text":"KeyboardShortcut"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI16KeyboardShortcutV12LocalizationV